[{"client_msg_id":"c7d4fd32-3a7f-4ed0-b96f-05d1fa9d7060","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"たしかに、基本関数でなんとかなりそうですね。\n内部的に denops の用意する共用キャッシュを使えば一応エコにいけるのかな。。。","ts":"1631529825.041700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pcDK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4A6DC88C-0266-4561-9D69-2F695DA51939","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"onChange関数にしちゃうのが良さそうかなと思いました","ts":"1631527747.041200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+Hi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7c4ea54-1f4b-48b4-bbc2-797d44b4275d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```import { bufs } from '...';\nbufs.onChange(denops, (stat) =\u0026gt; {\n  \n}, {\n  filetype: ['lua', 'markdown'],\n  buftype: '*'\n});```\nこんな感じですかね。。。","ts":"1631522524.040700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xdi9h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3FCF80E1-8B54-4E3A-807B-D3FC8692D63B","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"そうですね。グローバルストアにアクセスする方法のみモジュール化して実際のデータはグローバルストアに置く事でバージョンの差異があっても対応できます","ts":"1631522138.038900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i0y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cdac4f79-8733-4f0f-ae80-955e334a57f2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"denops_stdはvital的で良いと思う","ts":"1631522065.037600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zw81"}]},{"client_msg_id":"701c913c-2130-4127-8857-54122f3babb6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"各プラグインがmoduleをimportするイメージで合っています？","ts":"1631521920.036900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JJG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C08F5FA9-4076-4AA0-8A4C-70AF403C8E7A","type":"message","user":"U7766